        <register>
          <name>DOEPEACHMSK0</name>
          <description>This register is available in device mode and only when parameter OTG_MULTI_PROC_INTRPT=1. These registers are endpoint specific mask registers for (DOEPINTn). The OUT endpoint interrupt for a specific status in the DOEPINTn register can be masked by writing 0 to the corresponding bit in this register. Status bits are masked by default.</description>
